r Research Agent. Task breakdown document created documenting this assessment and noting future frontend tasks that will emerge in later phases (cost dashboard, provider health status UI, quality metrics display, configuration UI)."}}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_018wDEa5eFsqZwPPwXZndTRa', 'name': 'spawn_agent', 'input': {'agent_type': 'leadership/tdd_coordinator', 'input_data': {'problem_description': 'Milestone 1: Research & Documentation Phase - Complete comprehensive research and documentation to inform implementation strategy for API cost optimization system. This includes: 1) Analyzing current Anthropic API usage patterns across all agent types, 2) Auditing all 40+ agent definitions for autonomy levels and task complexity, 3) Researching local Claude deployment options and OpenAI model capabilities, 4) Creating cost comparison matrix between providers, 5) Designing decision framework for model selection, 6) Creating technical architecture design for multi-provider support, and 7) Documenting implementation approach with risk assessment. Output should be comprehensive research documents that inform subsequent implementation phases.', 'output_directory': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output', 'requirements_file': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements.md', 'architecture_file': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/architecture.md'}}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_018wDEa5eFsqZwPPwXZndTRa', 'content': '{"success": true, "result": null}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01VHmSwLfSP2e9XQuZM1GoLC', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'add_task', 'project_id': '71cf4a6c', 'description': 'Complete Milestone 1: Research & Documentation Phase', 'assigned_to': 'tdd_coordinator'}}