{"timestamp": "2026-01-16 23:18:20", "level": "DEBUG", "module": "anthropic._base_client", "message": "Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'timeout': Timeout(connect=5.0, read=600, write=600, pool=600), 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-aa03315e-5283-4349-86aa-83d59fc4cb51', 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 4096, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Please complete the following task:\n\n{\n  "requirements_file": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements.md",\n  "output_directory": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output",\n  "project_name": "API Cost Optimization - Local Claude & OpenAI Integration"\n}\n\nRemember to respond with valid JSON matching the expected output format.\n'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01M3MJanBt77znC37herJ2ur', 'name': 'read_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements.md'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01M3MJanBt77znC37herJ2ur', 'content': '{"success": true, "content": "# API Cost Optimization Research & Implementation Requirements\\n\\n## Project Overview\\n\\n**Project Name**: API Cost Optimization - Local Claude & OpenAI Integration  \\n**Objective**: Research and implement support for delegating tasks to local Claude instance and OpenAI API to reduce Anthropic API costs while maintaining quality\\n\\n## Problem Statement\\n\\nThe current Ensemble system exclusively uses Anthropic\'s Claude API for all agent operations, resulting in significant API costs. The user wants to:\\n\\n1. **Cost Reduction**: Find ways to reduce API expenses by leveraging alternative model providers\\n2. **Local Claude Integration**: Investigate using local Claude instances when available and suitable for autonomous tasks\\n3. **OpenAI API Support**: Add OpenAI API as an alternative provider for appropriate tasks\\n4. **Quality Maintenance**: Ensure delegation decisions maintain output quality and system functionality\\n\\n## Core Requirements\\n\\n### 1. Research & Documentation (Phase 1)\\n\\n**Research Document Deliverable**:\\n- Analyze current Anthropic API usage patterns across all agent types\\n- Document which agent tasks can operate autonomously (no user interaction needed)\\n- Research local Claude deployment options (ollama, local API servers, etc.)\\n- Evaluate OpenAI model capabilities vs current Claude usage\\n- Define cost comparison matrix between providers\\n- Create decision framework for model selection based on task complexity and autonomy level\\n- Document implementation approach and architecture changes needed\\n\\n**Agent Documentation Audit**:\\n- Review all 40+ agent definitions to identify:\\n  - Which agents perform fully autonomous tasks\\n  - Current model requirements and complexity ratings\\n  - Tasks suitable for local/cheaper models\\n  - Critical tasks requiring premium models\\n\\n### 2. OpenAI API Integration (Phase 2)\\n\\n**Technical Implementation**:\\n- Extend `runtime.py` to support OpenAI API alongside Anthropic\\n- Modify `model_selector.py` to include OpenAI models in selection logic\\n- Update `cost_calculator.py` for OpenAI pricing\\n- Add OpenAI configuration to environment management\\n- Implement fallback mechanisms (OpenAI \\u2192 Anthropic \\u2192 Local Claude)\\n\\n**Model Mapping**:\\n- Map agent complexity levels to appropriate OpenAI models (GPT-4, GPT-3.5-turbo, etc.)\\n- Update budget tier system to include OpenAI options\\n- Implement dynamic model selection based on task autonomy and complexity\\n\\n### 3. Local Claude Integration (Phase 3)\\n\\n**Local Provider Detection**:\\n- Auto-detect available local Claude instances (check common ports, endpoints)\\n- Implement health checks for local providers\\n- Create configuration system for local endpoint URLs\\n\\n**Task Delegation Logic**:\\n- Define criteria for local delegation:\\n  - Task can complete autonomously (no user input required)\\n  - Task complexity is low-to-medium\\n  - Local instance is healthy and responsive\\n- Implement intelligent routing: Local \\u2192 OpenAI \\u2192 Anthropic\\n\\n### 4. Cost Optimization Framework\\n\\n**Smart Model Selection**:\\n- Dynamic model selection based on:\\n  - Task autonomy level (fully autonomous vs requires user input)\\n  - Agent type and complexity rating\\n  - Available provider health status\\n  - Cost optimization goals vs quality requirements\\n- Implement cost tracking and reporting per provider\\n\\n**Quality Safeguards**:\\n- Automatic quality assessment of local/cheaper model outputs\\n- Fallback to premium models if quality metrics fail\\n- A/B testing framework to validate cost optimizations maintain quality\\n\\n## Technical Architecture\\n\\n### Current State Analysis\\n- **Runtime System**: `/src/runtime/agents/runtime.py` - Anthropic-only implementation\\n- **Model Selection**: `/src/runtime/agents/model_selector.py` - Claude model selection only\\n- **Cost Tracking**: `/src/runtime/agents/cost_calculator.py` - Anthropic pricing only\\n- **Agent Definitions**: 40+ agents with varying complexity and autonomy levels\\n\\n### Proposed Architecture\\n```\\nCost Optimization Layer\\n\\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 Provider Manager\\n\\u2502   \\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 AnthropicProvider (existing)\\n\\u2502   \\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 OpenAIProvider (new)\\n\\u2502   \\u2514\\u2500\\u2500 LocalClaudeProvider (new)\\n\\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 Smart Router\\n\\u2502   \\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 Task Analyzer (autonomy detection)\\n\\u2502   \\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 Provider Selector (cost/quality optimization)\\n\\u2502   \\u2514\\u2500\\u2500 Fallback Handler\\n\\u2514\\u2500\\u2500 Quality Monitor\\n    \\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 Output Validator\\n    \\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 Cost Tracker (multi-provider)\\n    \\u2514\\u2500\\u2500 Performance Reporter\\n```\\n\\n## Success Criteria\\n\\n### Functional Requirements\\n1. **Provider Support**: System supports Anthropic, OpenAI, and local Claude providers\\n2. **Automatic Routing**: Tasks automatically route to most cost-effective suitable provider\\n3. **Quality Maintenance**: Output quality metrics remain within 95% of baseline\\n4. **Cost Reduction**: Achieve 30-50% cost reduction on autonomous tasks\\n5. **Fallback Reliability**: Seamless fallback when preferred providers fail\\n\\n### Technical Requirements\\n1. **Backward Compatibility**: Existing agent definitions work without modification\\n2. **Configuration Flexibility**: Easy provider enablement/disablement via config\\n3. **Monitoring**: Comprehensive cost and quality tracking across providers\\n4. **Documentation**: Clear setup instructions for each provider type\\n\\n## Out of Scope\\n\\n- **Training Custom Models**: Focus on existing model APIs only\\n- **Agent Definition Modifications**: Avoid changing agent behaviors/capabilities\\n- **UI Changes**: Backend optimization only (UI changes come later)\\n- **Real-time Model Switching**: Single model per agent execution (no mid-task switching)\\n\\n## Constraints & Assumptions\\n\\n### Technical Constraints\\n- Must maintain existing agent hierarchy and spawn permissions\\n- Cannot break existing test suite\\n- Must preserve current debugging and metrics capabilities\\n\\n### Business Constraints\\n- No breaking changes to user-facing functionality\\n- Implementation must be reversible (can disable new providers)\\n- Quality cannot degrade below acceptable thresholds\\n\\n### Assumptions\\n- User has or can obtain OpenAI API credentials\\n- Local Claude instances (when available) have compatible APIs\\n- Cost savings justify implementation complexity\\n- Autonomous tasks can be reliably identified programmatically\\n\\n## Implementation Approach\\n\\n### Research First Strategy\\n1. **Phase 1**: Comprehensive research document with findings and recommendations\\n2. **Phase 2**: OpenAI integration as proof-of-concept for multi-provider approach\\n3. **Phase 3**: Local Claude integration based on research findings\\n4. **Phase 4**: Optimization and quality validation\\n\\n### Risk Mitigation\\n- Implement feature flags for gradual rollout\\n- Maintain detailed logging for debugging provider issues\\n- Create rollback procedures for each integration phase\\n- Establish quality baselines before implementing changes\\n\\n## Deliverables\\n\\n### Research Phase\\n- **Research Document**: Comprehensive analysis and implementation recommendations\\n- **Cost Analysis**: Provider comparison matrix with pricing projections\\n- **Agent Audit**: Documentation of autonomy levels and provider suitability per agent\\n- **Architecture Design**: Detailed technical design for multi-provider support\\n\\n### Implementation Phase\\n- **Provider Integration**: Working OpenAI and local Claude provider support\\n- **Smart Router**: Intelligent task-to-provider mapping system\\n- **Monitoring System**: Cost and quality tracking across providers\\n- **Documentation**: Setup guides and configuration reference\\n- **Test Suite**: Comprehensive tests for multi-provider scenarios\\n\\n## Notes & Context\\n\\n- User submitted via web UI seeking cost optimization for the ensemble system\\n- Current system has 40+ specialized agents with varying complexity levels\\n- Focus on autonomous task delegation to preserve user experience\\n- OpenAI integration serves as stepping stone to broader provider ecosystem\\n- Research document should inform implementation priorities and approaches\\n\\""}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01D7Sg6mvagebpDZAczc9G36', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'create_project', 'project_name': 'API Cost Optimization - Local Claude & OpenAI Integration', 'description': 'Research and implement support for delegating tasks to local Claude instance and OpenAI API to reduce Anthropic API costs while maintaining quality'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01D7Sg6mvagebpDZAczc9G36', 'content': '{"success": true, "project_id": "71cf4a6c", "message": "Created project: API Cost Optimization - Local Claude & OpenAI Integration", "summary": {"project_id": "71cf4a6c", "project_name": "API Cost Optimization - Local Claude & OpenAI Integration", "description": "Research and implement support for delegating tasks to local Claude instance and OpenAI API to reduce Anthropic API costs while maintaining quality", "status": "active", "created_at": "2026-01-16T23:14:27.621969", "updated_at": "2026-01-16T23:14:27.621969", "task_counts": {"total": 0, "todo": 0, "in_progress": 0, "completed": 0, "blocked": 0, "cancelled": 0}, "completion_percentage": 0.0, "recent_notes": [{"timestamp": "2026-01-16T23:14:27.621969", "author": "executive_director", "note": "Project \'API Cost Optimization - Local Claude & OpenAI Integration\' created", "category": "milestone"}], "output_directory": null}}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01NrUE9sCxo6y2Yf4CvnqRLb', 'name': 'write_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan.md', 'content': '# API Cost Optimization - Milestone Plan\n\n## Project Overview\n**Project Name**: API Cost Optimization - Local Claude & OpenAI Integration  \n**Objective**: Research and implement support for delegating tasks to local Claude instance and OpenAI API to reduce Anthropic API costs while maintaining quality\n\n## Milestone Breakdown\n\n### Milestone 1: Research & Documentation (Phase 1)\n**Duration**: 1-2 weeks  \n**Priority**: Critical Foundation  \n\n**Objective**: Complete comprehensive research and documentation to inform implementation strategy\n\n**Key Deliverables**:\n- Research document analyzing current API usage patterns and cost optimization opportunities\n- Agent audit documenting autonomy levels and provider suitability for all 40+ agents\n- Cost comparison matrix between Anthropic, OpenAI, and local Claude providers\n- Technical architecture design for multi-provider support\n- Implementation roadmap with risk assessment\n\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\n- [ ] Current Anthropic API usage patterns fully documented\n- [ ] All agent types analyzed for autonomy levels and task complexity\n- [ ] Local Claude deployment options researched with pros/cons\n- [ ] OpenAI model capabilities mapped to current Claude usage\n- [ ] Decision framework created for model selection\n- [ ] Technical architecture designed for provider abstraction\n- [ ] Cost projections calculated for 30-50% savings target\n\n**Dependencies**: None\n\n---\n\n### Milestone 2: OpenAI API Integration (Phase 2)\n**Duration**: 2-3 weeks  \n**Priority**: High - Proof of Concept  \n\n**Objective**: Implement OpenAI API support as foundation for multi-provider architecture\n\n**Key Deliverables**:\n- Extended runtime.py supporting both Anthropic and OpenAI APIs\n- Updated model_selector.py with OpenAI model mapping\n- Modified cost_calculator.py for multi-provider cost tracking\n- OpenAI configuration management and environment setup\n- Basic fallback mechanism (OpenAI → Anthropic)\n\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\n- [ ] OpenAI API successfully integrated alongside Anthropic\n- [ ] Agent tasks can execute using OpenAI models (GPT-4, GPT-3.5-turbo)\n- [ ] Cost tracking works for both providers\n- [ ] Fallback to Anthropic works when OpenAI fails\n- [ ] All existing tests pass with new provider support\n- [ ] Configuration system allows easy OpenAI enablement/disablement\n\n**Dependencies**: Milestone 1 research findings\n\n---\n\n### Milestone 3: Smart Provider Selection (Phase 2.5)\n**Duration**: 1-2 weeks  \n**Priority**: High - Core Functionality  \n\n**Objective**: Implement intelligent routing based on task autonomy and complexity\n\n**Key Deliverables**:\n- Smart router analyzing task autonomy levels\n- Dynamic model selection based on agent complexity ratings\n- Budget tier system extended for OpenAI options\n- Quality safeguards with automatic fallback\n- Cost optimization framework with tracking\n\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\n- [ ] Tasks automatically route to most cost-effective suitable provider\n- [ ] Autonomous tasks identified and preferentially routed to cheaper models\n- [ ] Quality assessment validates output before completion\n- [ ] Cost tracking reports savings by provider and agent type\n- [ ] Performance remains within 95% of baseline quality metrics\n\n**Dependencies**: Milestone 2 completion, OpenAI integration stable\n\n---\n\n### Milestone 4: Local Claude Integration (Phase 3)\n**Duration**: 2-3 weeks  \n**Priority**: Medium - Advanced Optimization  \n\n**Objective**: Add support for local Claude instances for maximum cost savings on autonomous tasks\n\n**Key Deliverables**:\n- Local Claude provider auto-detection system\n- Health checks and endpoint validation for local instances\n- Configuration system for custom local endpoints\n- Enhanced smart router with three-tier fallback (Local → OpenAI → Anthropic)\n- Documentation for setting up local Claude instances\n\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\n- [ ] System automatically detects available local Claude instances\n- [ ] Health checks ensure local providers are responsive\n- [ ] Autonomous tasks preferentially route to local instances when available\n- [ ] Three-tier fallback works reliably (Local → OpenAI → Anthropic)\n- [ ] Setup documentation enables users to configure local providers\n- [ ] Cost savings demonstrate maximum efficiency for autonomous tasks\n\n**Dependencies**: Milestone 3 completion, smart routing stable\n\n---\n\n### Milestone 5: Quality Validation & Optimization (Phase 4)\n**Duration**: 1-2 weeks  \n**Priority**: High - Quality Assurance  \n\n**Objective**: Validate cost optimizations maintain quality and optimize performance\n\n**Key Deliverables**:\n- Comprehensive A/B testing framework\n- Quality metrics baseline and ongoing monitoring\n- Performance optimization of provider selection logic\n- Complete test suite for multi-provider scenarios\n- Final documentation and setup guides\n\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\n- [ ] A/B testing validates quality maintained across providers\n- [ ] Cost savings achieve 30-50% target on autonomous tasks\n- [ ] Performance metrics show no degradation in system responsiveness\n- [ ] All tests pass including new multi-provider scenarios\n- [ ] Documentation complete for setup and configuration\n- [ ] System ready for production use with monitoring in place\n\n**Dependencies**: Milestone 4 completion, all providers integrated\n\n---\n\n### Milestone 6: Project Completion & Documentation\n**Duration**: 1 week  \n**Priority**: Medium - Delivery  \n\n**Objective**: Finalize project with complete documentation and monitoring\n\n**Key Deliverables**:\n- Final project report with achieved cost savings\n- Complete setup and configuration documentation\n- Monitoring dashboards for cost and quality tracking\n- Rollback procedures and troubleshooting guides\n- Handover documentation for ongoing maintenance\n\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\n- [ ] All deliverables completed and tested\n- [ ] Cost savings documented with real usage data\n- [ ] Setup guides enable easy replication\n- [ ] Monitoring systems provide ongoing visibility\n- [ ] Project successfully handed over for maintenance\n\n**Dependencies**: Milestone 5 completion\n\n## Risk Assessment\n\n**High Risk**:\n- Quality degradation from cheaper models\n- Local Claude instance reliability issues\n- OpenAI API rate limits affecting performance\n\n**Mitigation**:\n- Comprehensive quality monitoring with automatic fallbacks\n- Multiple provider options reduce single points of failure\n- Feature flags allow gradual rollout and easy rollback\n\n## Success Metrics\n\n- **Cost Reduction**: 30-50% savings on autonomous tasks\n- **Quality Maintenance**: 95%+ of baseline quality metrics\n- **Reliability**: 99%+ uptime with fallback mechanisms\n- **Performance**: No degradation in response times'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01NrUE9sCxo6y2Yf4CvnqRLb', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "File written successfully to /Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan.md (backup: /Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan_20260116_231500.md)", "backup_path": "/Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan_20260116_231500.md", "was_overwrite": true}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01G9smFri3nKF4LZkxaQgf2A', 'name': 'spawn_agent', 'input': {'agent_type': 'leadership/system_architect', 'input_data': {'requirements_file': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements.md', 'output_directory': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output', 'project_name': 'API Cost Optimization - Local Claude & OpenAI Integration'}}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01G9smFri3nKF4LZkxaQgf2A', 'content': '{"success": false, "error": "Missing required input field: output_file"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01V8szqB1mwGzYRymZUT3aeh', 'name': 'spawn_agent', 'input': {'agent_type': 'leadership/system_architect', 'input_data': {'requirements_file': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements.md', 'output_file': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/architecture.md', 'project_name': 'API Cost Optimization - Local Claude & OpenAI Integration'}}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01V8szqB1mwGzYRymZU