ized and changes committed to git.",\n  "self_analysis": "I successfully executed a comprehensive project initiation following proper Development Manager protocols. I read requirements thoroughly, created detailed milestone plan, spawned System Architect for architecture design, coordinated with all three Coordinators for task breakdown, and properly spawned TDD Coordinator for implementation. I maintained proper git workflow with meaningful commit messages and established project tracking. My approach was systematic and followed the sequential execution pattern required.",\n  "performance_analysis": "System Architect delivered excellent comprehensive architecture focusing on provider abstraction and intelligent routing. Backend Coordinator identified 8 well-structured research tasks with clear dependencies. Test Coordinator created appropriate validation strategy for research phase. Frontend Coordinator correctly identified no tasks for this research-focused phase. TDD Coordinator spawn was successful and is now executing the research implementation."\n}\n```'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "Good progress! You reported status='in_progress' and phase='implementation'. Please continue with the next step. Use the appropriate tools to proceed with implementation. Do not stop until all milestones are complete and status='success' with phase='complete'."}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_017bsiCKAu9kqpYrr58ap6wG', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'get_summary', 'project_id': '71cf4a6c'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_017bsiCKAu9kqpYrr58ap6wG', 'content': '{"success": true, "summary": {"project_id": "71cf4a6c", "project_name": "API Cost Optimization - Local Claude & OpenAI Integration", "description": "Research and implement support for delegating tasks to local Claude instance and OpenAI API to reduce Anthropic API costs while maintaining quality", "status": "active", "creat