{"timestamp": "2026-01-16 23:30:12", "level": "DEBUG", "module": "anthropic._base_client", "message": "Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'timeout': Timeout(connect=5.0, read=600, write=600, pool=600), 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-7e6aadda-e161-4fc8-9174-fbb673712998', 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 4096, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Please complete the following task:\n\n{\n  "requirements_file": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements.md",\n  "output_directory": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output",\n  "project_name": "Agent Management & Cleanup System"\n}\n\nRemember to respond with valid JSON matching the expected output format.\n'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01LGTqBSa7qXmbTYS7ECWude', 'name': 'read_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements.md'}}, {'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01DjaXMi8DyGoPcv3TW1yDqj', 'name': 'git_status', 'input': {'include_history': True}}, {'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01J5M63PK79tn31bB9tKJx1N', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'get_summary'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01LGTqBSa7qXmbTYS7ECWude', 'content': '{"success": true, "content": "# Agent Management & Cleanup System - Requirements\\n\\n## Vision\\nThe user needs to manage failed agents more effectively and clean up old data to improve system performance. Specifically:\\n1. Retry failed agents automatically, and if they fail again, delete them permanently\\n2. Provide a way to delete old completed jobs\\n3. Address system slowness caused by data accumulation\\n\\n## Current State Analysis\\nThe existing system has:\\n- **Recovery system** (`swarm_recovery.py`): Handles agent recovery with multiple strategies (RETRY, ESCALATE_MODEL, ABORT, etc.)\\n- **Swarm state** (`swarm_state.py`): SQLite-backed state management with cleanup_old_data() method\\n- **Backend APIs** (`main.py`): Endpoints for recovery, cleanup, and retention management\\n- **Data retention** (`data_retention.py`): Existing retention management\\n\\n## Objectives\\n\\n### Objective 1: Retry Failed Agents with Auto-Delete on Second Failure\\n**Priority: HIGH**\\n\\nCreate a \\"retry and delete\\" feature that:\\n1. Allows user to retry all currently failed agents\\n2. Tracks retry attempts for each failed agent\\n3. Automatically deletes agents that fail a second time after retry\\n4. Shows clear status in the UI of what happened (retried, deleted, succeeded)\\n\\n**Technical Requirements:**\\n- Add new API endpoint: `POST /api/agents/retry-all-failed`\\n  - Finds all agents with status = \'failed\' \\n  - Queues each for retry with a \\"delete_on_failure\\" flag\\n  - Returns count of agents queued for retry\\n- Add new API endpoint: `POST /api/agents/{agent_id}/retry-and-delete`\\n  - Retries single agent, deletes if it fails again\\n- Modify recovery system to track \\"second_failure\\" and auto-delete\\n- Add frontend button \\"Retry All Failed (auto-delete on 2nd failure)\\"\\n\\n### Objective 2: Delete Old Completed Jobs\\n**Priority: HIGH**\\n\\nCreate a job cleanup feature that:\\n1. Shows list of old completed jobs/sessions\\n2. Allows bulk deletion by age (e.g., \\"Delete jobs older than 7 days\\")\\n3. Allows individual deletion of specific completed jobs\\n4. Includes confirmation before destructive actions\\n\\n**Technical Requirements:**\\n- Add new API endpoint: `DELETE /api/jobs/completed`\\n  - Query params: `older_than_days` (optional), `session_ids` (optional list)\\n  - Deletes sessions and all associated data (agents, messages, events, etc.)\\n  - Returns count of deleted items\\n- Add new API endpoint: `GET /api/jobs/completed/stats`\\n  - Returns count and size of completed jobs, grouped by age\\n- Add frontend component for job cleanup:\\n  - Shows completed jobs with age\\n  - Bulk delete by age slider/dropdown\\n  - Individual delete buttons\\n  - Confirmation modal before delete\\n\\n### Objective 3: Performance Improvements\\n**Priority: MEDIUM**\\n\\nAddress system slowness by:\\n1. Adding database vacuuming after bulk deletes\\n2. Implementing smarter data loading (pagination, lazy loading)\\n3. Adding database size monitoring\\n4. Cleaning up orphaned data\\n\\n**Technical Requirements:**\\n- Add `VACUUM` after bulk deletes\\n- Add API to get database size: `GET /api/system/db-stats`\\n- Add cleanup of orphaned records (messages/events without parent agents)\\n- Consider adding index optimizations if needed\\n\\n## Scope Constraints\\n**IN SCOPE:**\\n- Backend API endpoints for the features above\\n- Frontend UI components for retry and cleanup\\n- Modifications to existing recovery system\\n- Documentation updates\\n\\n**OUT OF SCOPE:**\\n- Automatic scheduled cleanup (can be added later)\\n- Archive to external storage (just delete for now)\\n- Undo/recovery of deleted data\\n- Complex data migration\\n\\n## Success Criteria\\n1. User can click one button to retry all failed agents\\n2. Agents that fail twice are automatically deleted\\n3. User can see and delete old completed jobs by age\\n4. System performance noticeably improves after cleanup\\n5. All existing functionality continues to work\\n\\n## Technical Constraints\\n- Must work with existing SQLite database schema\\n- Must not break existing API endpoints\\n- Must be accessible from the existing React frontend\\n- Should follow existing code patterns\\n\\n## Assumptions Made\\n- \\"Failed agents\\" means agents with status = \'failed\' in the database\\n- \\"Completed jobs\\" means sessions with status = \'completed\'\\n- \\"Delete\\" means permanent removal from database (no soft delete)\\n- Performance issues are primarily from data volume, not code issues\\n\\n## Files to Modify/Create\\n\\n### Backend (Python)\\n1. **src/runtime/agents/swarm_recovery.py** - Add retry-and-delete logic\\n2. **src/runtime/agents/swarm_state.py** - Add delete methods\\n3. **src/field/ensemble_ui/backend/main.py** - Add new API endpoints\\n\\n### Frontend (React)\\n1. **New: src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/src/components/JobCleanupPanel.jsx** - UI for job cleanup\\n2. **Modify: RecoveryDashboard.jsx** - Add retry-all-failed button\\n3. **Modify: App.jsx** - Add navigation to cleanup panel\\n\\n## Implementation Priority\\n1. First: API endpoints for retry-all-failed and delete completed jobs\\n2. Second: Modify recovery system for auto-delete on second failure\\n3. Third: Frontend components\\n4. Fourth: Performance optimizations and testing\\n"}'}, {'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01DjaXMi8DyGoPcv3TW1yDqj', 'content': '{"success": true, "current_branch": "tmux_monitoring_dashboard_implementation", "changes": {"staged": [{"file": "eadership/development_manager.md", "status": "M"}], "unstaged": [{"file": "leadership/development_manager.md.pre_improvement", "status": "M"}, {"file": "leadership/executive_director.md", "status": "M"}, {"file": "leadership/executive_director.md.pre_improvement", "status": "M"}, {"file": "logs/ensemble-backend.log.1", "status": "M"}, {"file": "logs/ensemble-backend.log.2", "status": "M"}, {"file": "logs/ensemble-backend.log.3", "status": "M"}, {"file": "logs/ensemble-backend.log.4", "status": "M"}, {"file": "src/field/ensemble_ui/backend/main.py", "status": "M"}, {"file": "src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements.md", "status": "M"}], "untracked": ["docs/archive/index.md", "src/field/ensemble_ui/output/tmux_monitoring_dashboard/backend_implementation_plan_m3.md"]}, "has_changes": true, "clean": false, "ahead": 0, "behind": 0, "last_commit": {"hash": "f57958ab035753c52bf7a1402397e2e762bcb061", "message": "Complete Milestone 1 setup: API Cost Optimization research and documentation phase initiated", "author": "Matt Billock", 